        fix: address code review findings (5 important, 6 minor)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-04-03T15:02:53Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43607145?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>gong1414</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/gong1414</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix: address code review findings (5 important, 6 minor)

Important fixes:
- I-1: is_cloze now uses regex \{\{c\d+:: to prevent false positives
- I-2: AnkiConnect version check catches RuntimeError
- I-3: Split test_parser.py into test_models.py + test_parser.py
- I-4: Improved error message with expected model names and fields
- I-5: All exporter tests use tmp_path fixture for auto cleanup

Minor fixes:
- M-1: Move import sys to top of parser.py
- M-2: Move export_ankiconnect import to top of cli.py
- M-4: deck_id fallback to 1 if hash produces 0
- M-5: Add AnkiConnect example to SKILL.md export section
- M-7: Add __all__ to __init__.py for public API
- M-9: Pin genanki upper bound (&amp;lt;1.0)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
